dialog.black_cat.heal.light=§dBlack Cat:§r Something simple... but useful. Don’t get used to seeing me grateful.
dialog.black_cat.heal.meal=§dBlack Cat:§r Now that’s how you take care of an ally. Nice touch, Spider.
dialog.black_cat.heal.golden=§dBlack Cat:§r A golden apple for me? Well, someone wants to earn all nine of my lives.
dialog.black_cat.heal.full=§dBlack Cat:§r Now I feel perfect. Try not to ruin it, okay?
dialog.black_cat.heal.bad=§dBlack Cat:§r Rotten food? Careful, darling. Trust can be poisoned too.

dialog.punisher.heal.light=§8Punisher:§r Supplies received. Enough to keep moving.
dialog.punisher.heal.meal=§8Punisher:§r Good food. Keeps the team on its feet.
dialog.punisher.heal.golden=§8Punisher:§r Golden apple. Useful. You didn’t waste it.
dialog.punisher.heal.full=§8Punisher:§r Full recovery. I’m back in the fight.
dialog.punisher.heal.bad=§8Punisher:§r That’s not help. That’s a bad decision.

dialog.punisher.night.1=§8Punisher:§r The night favors criminals... and us too.
dialog.punisher.night.2=§8Punisher:§r That’s when they come out of hiding.
dialog.punisher.night.3=§8Punisher:§r Keep your eyes open.

dialog.punisher.health.1=§8Punisher:§r I’ve taken worse hits.
dialog.punisher.health.2=§8Punisher:§r I can still fight.

