dialog.punisher.interact.low.1=§8Punisher:§r Don’t mistake working together for friendship.
dialog.punisher.interact.low.2=§8Punisher:§r If you let your guard down, I’m not coming to save you.
dialog.punisher.interact.low.3=§8Punisher:§r Prove I can trust you.
dialog.punisher.interact.low.4=§8Punisher:§r I’ve seen too many heroes fall because they trusted the wrong people.
dialog.punisher.interact.low.5=§8Punisher:§r Talk less. Keep your eyes open.

dialog.punisher.interact.high.1=§8Punisher:§r You’ve proven you know how to survive.
dialog.punisher.interact.high.2=§8Punisher:§r I don’t say this often... good work.
dialog.punisher.interact.high.3=§8Punisher:§r Watch my back, and I’ll watch yours.
dialog.punisher.interact.high.4=§8Punisher:§r I’m starting to think you make a difference.
dialog.punisher.interact.high.5=§8Punisher:§r As long as we fight together, those criminals won’t get a moment’s rest.

dialog.punisher.follow=§8Punisher:§r Don’t stray too far.
dialog.punisher.free=§8Punisher:§r If anything shows up, I’ll handle it.

dialog.punisher.recruit.1=§8Punisher:§r That ID proves you’re with the Avengers... I’ll work with you.
dialog.punisher.recruit.2=§8Punisher:§r I don’t take orders from just anyone. But I’ll give you a chance.

dialog.punisher.respect.1=§8Punisher:§r You’re learning.
dialog.punisher.respect.2=§8Punisher:§r Good work.
dialog.punisher.respect.3=§8Punisher:§r I’m starting to trust you.
dialog.punisher.respect.4=§8Punisher:§r That was professional.

dialog.punisher.assist.1=§8Punisher:§r Good shot. Keep it up.
dialog.punisher.assist.2=§8Punisher:§r You fight better than I expected.
dialog.punisher.assist.3=§8Punisher:§r We taught them a lesson today.
dialog.punisher.assist.4=§8Punisher:§r Working with you makes this easier.

dialog.punisher.respect.25=§8Punisher:§r Looks like you know what you’re doing.
dialog.punisher.respect.50=§8Punisher:§r I’m starting to trust you.
dialog.punisher.respect.75=§8Punisher:§r You’ve proven yourself a true ally.
dialog.punisher.respect.100=§8Punisher:§r If I ever need someone watching my back, it’ll be you.

dialog.punisher.idle.1=§8Punisher:§r Stay alert.
dialog.punisher.idle.2=§8Punisher:§r The city never sleeps.
dialog.punisher.idle.3=§8Punisher:§r Criminals always come back.
dialog.punisher.idle.4=§8Punisher:§r Make the most of this quiet moment.
dialog.punisher.idle.5=§8Punisher:§r Don’t let your guard down.

