dialog.punisher.enemy.1=§8Punisher:§r There they are... don’t lose sight of them.
dialog.punisher.enemy.2=§8Punisher:§r We’ve got company.
dialog.punisher.enemy.3=§8Punisher:§r Time to clean up the streets.

dialog.punisher.owner_hit.1=§8Punisher:§r Watch your strikes. I’m not here to take friendly fire.
dialog.punisher.owner_hit.2=§8Punisher:§r Bad decision. Aim at the enemy next time.
dialog.punisher.owner_hit.3=§8Punisher:§r That mistake costs trust. Stay disciplined.

