dialog.black_cat.enemy.1=§dBlack Cat:§r We’ve got company nearby. And they don’t look like the tipping kind.
dialog.black_cat.enemy.2=§dBlack Cat:§r I hear something moving nearby... get your webs ready, Spider.
dialog.black_cat.enemy.3=§dBlack Cat:§r We’re not alone. There’s a monster nearby ruining the night.

dialog.black_cat.owner_hit.1=§dBlack Cat:§r Was that a hit, or a terrible way to get my attention?
dialog.black_cat.owner_hit.2=§dBlack Cat:§r Careful, Spider. Trust can be broken by the wrong claws too.
dialog.black_cat.owner_hit.3=§dBlack Cat:§r If you’re going to treat me like that, maybe I should go back to working alone.

dialog.black_cat.approach.low.1=§dBlack Cat:§r Well, look who came over. Are you here to help, or just get in the way with style?
dialog.black_cat.approach.low.2=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t get excited, we’re not partners yet. But you can walk beside me... for now.
dialog.black_cat.approach.low.3=§dBlack Cat:§r If you want trust, you’ll have to earn it. I don’t give away my nine lives.

dialog.black_cat.approach.high.1=§dBlack Cat:§r There you are, Spider. I was starting to think the night would get boring.
dialog.black_cat.approach.high.2=§dBlack Cat:§r Right on time. Trouble is usually more fun when I’m around.
dialog.black_cat.approach.high.3=§dBlack Cat:§r I like it when you show up like this. It makes the city feel a little less dangerous... almost.

dialog.black_cat.play_night.end.1=§dBlack Cat:§r I don’t think that suit suited you anymore.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.end.2=§dBlack Cat:§r Good morning... you slept pretty deeply.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.end.3=§dBlack Cat:§r I hope you don’t mind... I borrowed something from your closet.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.end.4=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t make that face... you look adorable like this.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.end.5=§dBlack Cat:§r Now we have a little secret between us.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.end.6=§dBlack Cat:§r I guess tonight was unforgettable.

dialog.black_cat.play_night.start.1=§dBlack Cat:§r Tonight... you’re all mine.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.start.2=§dBlack Cat:§r Let’s forget the villains for one night.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.start.3=§dBlack Cat:§r Come here... I have something special prepared.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.start.4=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t worry... I promise I’ll behave.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.start.5=§dBlack Cat:§r After everything we’ve been through... you’ve earned it.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.start.6=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t stare so much... come here.

dialog.black_cat.theft.1=§dBlack Cat:§r Oops... was that yours?
dialog.black_cat.theft.2=§dBlack Cat:§r I’ll borrow it... maybe I’ll give it back.
dialog.black_cat.theft.3=§dBlack Cat:§r Too slow, Spider.
dialog.black_cat.theft.4=§dBlack Cat:§r Did you really think I wouldn’t notice?
dialog.black_cat.theft.5=§dBlack Cat:§r Catch me if you can!
dialog.black_cat.theft.6=§dBlack Cat:§r You always make this fun.

dialog.black_cat.play_night.betrayal.1=§dBlack Cat:§r It was a fun night, Spider... but don’t confuse fun with loyalty.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.betrayal.2=§dBlack Cat:§r I told you trusting a thief was dangerous. Thanks for the memories... and everything else.
dialog.black_cat.play_night.betrayal.3=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t take it personally, darling. I just followed my nature: break in, steal, and disappear.

