dialog.black_cat.low_respect.1=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t get the wrong idea. I still don’t trust you.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.2=§dBlack Cat:§r If this goes wrong, I’m not saving you twice.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.3=§dBlack Cat:§r You’re useful... for now.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.4=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t give me a reason to regret this.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.5=§dBlack Cat:§r I’ve worked alone for a long time. Don’t ruin this.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.6=§dBlack Cat:§r You have talent, but you also have a lot of problems.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.7=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t let your guard down. I won’t.
dialog.black_cat.low_respect.8=§dBlack Cat:§r Maybe you can earn my trust... someday.

dialog.black_cat.high_respect.1=§dBlack Cat:§r I like working with you, little spider.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.2=§dBlack Cat:§r You’ve got style. Not as much as me, but close.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.3=§dBlack Cat:§r I knew I could trust you.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.4=§dBlack Cat:§r I admit, you make this more fun.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.5=§dBlack Cat:§r Good work. You almost impressed me.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.6=§dBlack Cat:§r With you around, this feels less boring.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.7=§dBlack Cat:§r Don’t get excited, but I’m glad to see you.
dialog.black_cat.high_respect.8=§dBlack Cat:§r Watch my back, and I’ll watch yours.

dialog.black_cat.follow_me=§dBlack Cat:§r Fine, I’ll go with you. Just don’t walk so slowly.
dialog.black_cat.stop_following=§dBlack Cat:§r Perfect, I’ll stay around here. Don’t miss me too much.
dialog.black_cat.not_owner=§dBlack Cat:§r Sorry, darling. I don’t work for you.

entity.spidermanaddon:black_cat.name=Black Cat
action.interact.black_cat=Interact
item.spidermanaddon:black_cat_contract.name=Black Cat Contract
dialog.black_cat.stolen=§dBlack Cat:§r Thanks for the diamond. If you want it back... catch me.
dialog.black_cat.captured=§dBlack Cat:§r Fine... I admit you’re faster than I expected.
dialog.black_cat.escape=§dBlack Cat:§r Too slow, Spider. Until next time.
dialog.black_cat.need_contract=§dBlack Cat:§r You think I work for free? Bring me a better offer.
dialog.black_cat.recruited=§dBlack Cat:§r Fine... I’ll work with you. But don’t expect me to follow the rules.
