dialogue.j_jonah_jameson.random.2=I want pictures of Spider-Man, not excuses.
dialogue.j_jonah_jameson.random.3=If that wall-crawler shows up, I want the exclusive on my desk.
dialogue.j_jonah_jameson.random.4=The city needs real news, not heroes jumping across rooftops.
dialogue.j_jonah_jameson.random.5=Parker! Wait... you’re not Parker. Fine, move fast anyway.

